- OpenAI Codex CLI (`@openai/codex`) — Apache-2.0 License, Copyright OpenAI.
- Anthropic Claude Code CLI (`@anthropic-ai/claude-code`) — Copyright Anthropic, PBC.

No proprietary binaries, credentials, OAuth tokens, or API keys are included in
this repository. All quota and telemetry inspection runs 100% locally against
the user's own authenticated CLI sessions.
